OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over #4.5m space centre
OL,4,Afunding approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition parties are questioning why
OL,7,F#4.5m of public regeneration money is
OL,8,Fneeded to support a US-owned space
OL,9,Ftesting centre in Keighley.
OL,11,FBradford Council's executive, led by
OL,12,FReform UK, has approved the grant for
OL,13,FSpace Test North at Providence Park,
OL,14,Fwith York-registered BSC Filters
OL,15,Ffunding the remainder of the #9m
OL,16,Fdevelopment.
OL,18,FBSC Filters is part of US-headquartered
OL,19,Fgroup Dover Corporation, which reported
OL,20,Frevenues of about $8.1bn in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
