OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over #4.5m space centre
OL,4,Afunding approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project is set to create 50 jobs,
OL,7,Fwith the council's leadership recently
OL,8,Fvoting through what it described as
OL,9,F"precisely the opportunity Keighley
OL,10,Fshould be pursuing".
